      "text": "It’s a fun romp with all the insane stunts you’d expect from a mission impossible.\nThey’ve somewhat dropped the intrigue parts of previous installations and replaced with some (slightly heavy handed but heartfelt) messages on the theme of coping in today’s political environment — valuable (maybe needed?) but perhaps a bit much?\n\nOver all well worth a watch if you like great action stunts, and a worthy end to a very fun series of films.",
